        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Otomedius Gorgeous is the Xbox 360 port of Otomedius Arcade, a side scrolling shooter by Konami which featured personification of space fighters from various Konami games like Gradius, Xexex, Salamander and Parodius. The name is a pun, being a portmanteau of the terms \"otome\" (meaning \"maiden\" in Japanese) and \"Gradius\". It was released for the Japanese Xbox 360 in November 20, 2008.",
